{
  "about": "How both apps interrupt Jarvis by talking, when they play \"One moment.\", and the small \"I heard you\" sound (docs/JARVIS-API.md section 17). Written by hand: these are the apps' own rules, with no backend answer to record. Read by jarvis-desktop/tests/voice-flow.mjs (src/voice-flow.js) and jarvis-client VoiceFlowTest.kt (voice/VoiceFlow.kt). The numbers must be the ones each app uses; every scenario is played through each app's pure rules, step by step, and must give `expect` at every step that has one. Times are milliseconds on one clock.",
