  "question_about": "Keep listening after a question: when the last sentence Jarvis spoke ends with one of `question_marks` (closing quotes and brackets after it allowed; a plain \";\" only in Greek text, where Unicode folds the Greek question mark into it), the next hands-free clip needs no \"hey Jarvis\". Read by backend test_wakeword.py (jarvis_speech.ends_with_question) and the phone's VoiceFlowTest.kt (VoiceFlow.endsWithQuestion).",
